WEBVTT

00:26.609 --> 00:27.652
Untie me.

00:30.822 --> 00:31.823
What?

00:33.616 --> 00:35.994
You still can't beat me in a fair fight?

00:44.586 --> 00:47.005
You still have that look in your eyes.

00:49.424 --> 00:51.217
Like you fear nothing.

01:02.145 --> 01:03.855
Now, this look I like.

01:09.069 --> 01:11.196
Listen,
Mango doesn't know anyone.

01:11.279 --> 01:12.280
Captain.

01:13.364 --> 01:15.033
I can't reach Detective Jeon.

01:15.116 --> 01:17.118
He asked me to look up a location…

01:17.202 --> 01:18.036
And?

01:18.119 --> 01:20.413
And his phone was turned off
right after he arrived.

01:30.965 --> 01:32.258
Did you get him?

01:32.342 --> 01:33.802
Hello, Gangjae.

01:35.428 --> 01:36.471
Oh.

01:38.056 --> 01:40.058
Those idiots.

01:42.102 --> 01:43.645
I knew you'd come here.

01:45.563 --> 01:47.690
Well, I didn't wanna go
empty-handed,

01:47.774 --> 01:50.276
so I've been preparing a gift for you.

01:51.611 --> 01:53.404
Look here.

01:57.200 --> 02:00.245
OH HYEJIN

02:03.248 --> 02:04.290
Hurry up.

02:04.374 --> 02:06.376
There isn't much time.

02:07.335 --> 02:09.170
If you wanna get a corpse.

02:15.135 --> 02:17.846
You thought you were
something special, didn't you?

02:17.929 --> 02:19.597
You are…

02:20.390 --> 02:22.475
…absolutely nothing.

02:23.059 --> 02:24.727
Let Detective Jeon go.

02:25.645 --> 02:27.522
He has nothing to do with this.

02:31.568 --> 02:32.986
How about you…

02:33.778 --> 02:38.449
just worry about
what I'm about to do to you.

02:39.742 --> 02:41.911
I'll play with you all night long.

02:53.131 --> 02:55.508
Aargh! Goddamn!

02:58.678 --> 03:01.848
I wanted Choi Mujin to watch you die!

03:01.931 --> 03:02.974
Detective!

03:03.683 --> 03:06.144
Hey. Say your final words.

03:07.103 --> 03:08.563
I'll relay it for you.

03:11.399 --> 03:13.484
I'll kill you as soon as I can.

03:22.785 --> 03:23.828
Do it.

03:45.058 --> 03:47.352
This must hurt like hell.

03:49.145 --> 03:50.813
As I crushed you,

03:50.897 --> 03:52.690
your skull will crack open

03:53.358 --> 03:55.902
and your brain will ooze out.

03:58.821 --> 04:00.281
It would be fun to watch,

04:00.365 --> 04:02.283
but I don't have the time.

04:04.911 --> 04:06.037
See ya.

04:17.090 --> 04:18.299
Wake up, Pildo!

04:55.128 --> 04:56.587
Gangjae!

05:51.809 --> 05:52.894
Get out.

05:53.478 --> 05:54.687
Get out now!

07:01.587 --> 07:02.839
Pildo!

07:11.013 --> 07:12.515
Pildo!

07:19.689 --> 07:21.315
Gosh!

07:21.399 --> 07:22.650
Pildo!

07:22.733 --> 07:23.568
OH HYEJIN

07:30.616 --> 07:31.617
Pildo!

07:32.577 --> 07:33.578
Oh, my god.

07:33.661 --> 07:34.704
Pildo.

07:35.246 --> 07:36.164
How did you get here?

07:36.247 --> 07:37.457
I'm serious.

07:38.332 --> 07:39.292
Damn it.

07:41.127 --> 07:43.546
A detective gets handcuffed.

07:43.629 --> 07:44.672
Good going.

07:46.007 --> 07:47.758
You crazy bastard. Get up.

07:52.138 --> 07:54.265
Why does it feel nice being cursed at?

07:56.184 --> 07:57.310
You okay?

07:57.393 --> 07:58.352
Yeah.

07:59.145 --> 08:00.229
- I'm okay.
- Hey.

08:00.313 --> 08:01.647
Hey, hey!

08:41.896 --> 08:43.105
Are you all right, sir?

08:49.529 --> 08:50.988
Why did you go alone?

08:54.033 --> 08:55.993
Gangjae attempted to kill Jiwoo.

08:59.205 --> 09:00.540
So because of Jiwoo.

09:04.502 --> 09:05.920
You could have been killed.

09:13.302 --> 09:14.929
Jiwoo shot the gun on the ship.

09:19.100 --> 09:21.936
She perform the action
at the risk of exposing herself.

09:26.023 --> 09:27.233
What did you do?

09:28.568 --> 09:29.443
Huh?

09:31.696 --> 09:32.738
Taeju.

09:34.782 --> 09:35.825
Taeju!

09:42.540 --> 09:43.958
Can you be trusted?

09:51.173 --> 09:52.300
I'm sorry, sir.

10:04.645 --> 10:06.439
She's in surgery right now.

10:06.522 --> 10:07.398
Hold on.

10:08.941 --> 10:10.234
How long will the surgery take?

10:10.943 --> 10:12.069
We don't know yet.

10:12.153 --> 10:14.405
We have to catch that asshole Do Gangjae.

10:15.573 --> 10:17.158
You go and get some treatment first.

10:18.951 --> 10:21.287
We can catch punks
like Do Gangjae whenever.

10:21.370 --> 10:23.247
That asshole stabbed my partner!

10:23.331 --> 10:24.624
Pildo!

10:28.252 --> 10:30.046
I choose to trust Detective Oh.

11:55.589 --> 11:56.632
Sir…

11:57.341 --> 12:00.302
we can't send my team out
with those psychos running lose.

12:00.386 --> 12:02.513
All Narcotics members
will carry firearms

12:02.596 --> 12:04.682
until the situation is resolved.

12:05.349 --> 12:06.559
- Hello.
- Hello.

12:06.642 --> 12:07.935
- Police.
- Yes.

12:08.018 --> 12:10.062
Can I take a look
at the video on that camera?

12:12.648 --> 12:13.941
Have you seen this man?

12:15.067 --> 12:16.569
Girls. Come over here.

12:16.652 --> 12:18.237
Look at this.

12:18.320 --> 12:20.990
This is Do Gangjae and Kim Cheolho.

12:21.073 --> 12:22.616
Have you seen them?

12:41.761 --> 12:45.306
- Where's Gangjae?
- I don't know!

12:45.890 --> 12:49.393
Burn in hell, you motherfuckers!

12:49.977 --> 12:51.937
The result isn't going to change.

12:52.646 --> 12:56.150
You can end it quickly
or you can let it drag out.

13:36.023 --> 13:37.858
Let's not waste our energy.

13:53.374 --> 13:55.292
- Stay still, assholes.
- Sons of bitches!

13:55.876 --> 13:57.878
You have the right to remain silent.

13:57.962 --> 13:59.296
You have the right to an attorney.

13:59.380 --> 14:00.923
You have the right to remain silent.

14:01.006 --> 14:02.591
But don't do that.

14:02.675 --> 14:04.134
Because I'm pissed off.

14:43.757 --> 14:45.134
I'm sorry, sir. Gangjae…

14:59.231 --> 15:00.190
Have you eaten?

15:01.942 --> 15:03.193
No, sir. Not yet.

15:03.736 --> 15:04.904
Want samgyetang?

15:06.488 --> 15:07.489
Yes, sir.

15:08.240 --> 15:09.491
We used to go there often.

15:10.034 --> 15:11.118
Simakse.

15:11.702 --> 15:12.703
Yes, sir.

15:20.544 --> 15:21.587
Right.

15:22.338 --> 15:24.006
You had a thing for their daughter.

15:25.466 --> 15:26.592
No, sir.

15:26.675 --> 15:27.843
Guess it didn't work out.

15:30.179 --> 15:31.555
It wasn't anything, sir.

15:40.648 --> 15:41.899
I know you're trying.

15:49.031 --> 15:50.950
Let's see what Narcotics does next.

15:53.369 --> 15:55.579
Gangjae will show up
if driven to a corner.

15:56.205 --> 15:57.289
Yes, sir.

16:11.595 --> 16:12.805
Papa.

16:15.891 --> 16:16.934
Papa!

16:28.862 --> 16:29.780
Papa.

16:30.322 --> 16:31.657
Papa?

16:31.740 --> 16:33.325
Papa, open the door.

17:05.816 --> 17:06.775
Papa!

17:07.943 --> 17:09.028
Papa!

17:09.695 --> 17:11.530
Papa! Don't go!

17:11.613 --> 17:13.657
Please don't leave me here alone!

17:13.741 --> 17:16.702
Papa!

17:18.871 --> 17:21.040
Papa! Don't go!

17:21.123 --> 17:23.000
Papa!

17:40.017 --> 17:41.185
Are you okay?

17:49.276 --> 17:51.070
You scowl even when you sleep.

17:55.324 --> 17:57.076
You won't last long like that.

18:01.205 --> 18:03.207
I used to live for revenge like you do.

18:06.960 --> 18:08.420
I had a little sister.

18:10.047 --> 18:12.716
She went clubbing
to celebrate getting into college,

18:13.842 --> 18:15.344
her beer was drugged.

18:17.262 --> 18:18.639
She died right then.

18:21.892 --> 18:23.352
She had a weak heart.

18:27.523 --> 18:29.274
Did they catch who did it?

18:29.942 --> 18:30.818
No.

18:31.318 --> 18:33.487
Don't know who it was.

18:35.239 --> 18:38.242
If we catch all the drug dealers
and drug ring members,

18:38.784 --> 18:40.202
he'll probably be among them.

18:45.541 --> 18:47.584
I don't know who it is you wanna catch,

18:49.461 --> 18:50.629
but I'll help you.

18:51.547 --> 18:52.756
Let's get him together.

19:00.722 --> 19:01.849
Here's some clothes.

19:01.932 --> 19:03.183
I'll get your papers done.

19:16.155 --> 19:17.698
How're you doing? You okay?

19:20.492 --> 19:21.493
Touch this.

19:23.370 --> 19:24.496
Touch right here.

19:28.041 --> 19:29.293
So awesome, right?

19:31.962 --> 19:33.463
The bump won't go down.

19:34.631 --> 19:36.884
One centimeter over,
and I would have died.

19:36.967 --> 19:37.968
God.

19:38.927 --> 19:40.762
Your hand is covered in scars.

19:45.475 --> 19:46.935
Because I was a coward.

19:51.481 --> 19:52.566
Not anymore.

19:53.317 --> 19:54.902
When I first joined Narcotics…

19:56.987 --> 19:58.363
When someone had a knife,

19:59.323 --> 20:00.532
I used my hands.

20:30.437 --> 20:31.939
Detective Oh! Hey.

20:33.941 --> 20:35.484
Let's go inside. It's cold.

20:43.075 --> 20:43.951
After getting stabbed,

20:44.034 --> 20:45.869
you need to fill
that hole with meat, you know.

20:46.703 --> 20:49.122
We're using our remaining
team outing budget.

20:50.207 --> 20:52.876
Hold on, Detective Oh
should be drinking something warm.

20:52.960 --> 20:53.877
Here.

20:55.254 --> 20:56.296
What is that?

20:56.964 --> 20:58.590
It's some chamomile tea.

20:58.674 --> 21:00.550
Nice, Gunpyeong.

21:00.634 --> 21:02.177
Chamomile.

21:02.261 --> 21:03.929
- Just grill the meat properly.
- Yes, sir.

21:04.012 --> 21:05.472
Detective Oh's hungry.

21:05.555 --> 21:07.933
Well done or medium? Which do you like?

21:08.642 --> 21:09.685
Daesoo is too unrefined

21:09.768 --> 21:11.853
and can't eat this
unless it's fully cooked.

21:11.937 --> 21:14.147
Yeah, right. I eat beef tartare.

21:14.231 --> 21:15.607
You punk.

21:15.691 --> 21:17.526
Don't make her laugh. It'll hurt.

21:17.609 --> 21:19.111
Sorry.

21:23.991 --> 21:25.075
You're a miracle.

21:25.158 --> 21:26.743
You're back with all of us.

21:26.827 --> 21:27.744
Oh Hyejin.

21:32.833 --> 21:33.750
Cheers.

21:40.173 --> 21:41.925
What meat is this?

21:42.009 --> 21:43.802
That's beef and that's mushroom.

21:45.554 --> 21:46.430
Flip this.

22:05.198 --> 22:06.742
Mr. Choi. It's me.

22:07.617 --> 22:08.994
I know where Jiwoo is.

22:11.872 --> 22:13.665
We need to send someone out.

22:16.710 --> 22:17.753
Who is she?

22:23.050 --> 22:24.301
A friend's daughter.

22:25.218 --> 22:27.471
Book a flight
and find her a place to live.

22:29.765 --> 22:31.266
A house on the beach.

22:34.061 --> 22:35.270
I'll do that now, sir.

23:03.006 --> 23:04.007
CHOI MUJIN, CEO OF HOTEL LIBER

23:04.091 --> 23:05.384
CHARGED FOR DRUGS AND ASSAULT,
DONGCHEON

23:44.631 --> 23:46.091
Shut it down and get out of there.

23:47.217 --> 23:49.511
I'll make preparations
so you can leave the country.

23:50.095 --> 23:51.263
I can't do that.

23:52.931 --> 23:53.849
Jiwoo.

23:54.683 --> 23:56.184
I still got to check on something.

23:56.268 --> 23:57.310
Yoon Jiwoo!

23:58.979 --> 24:00.021
Do as I say.

24:01.148 --> 24:03.191
If they capture him, you'll be in danger.

24:05.944 --> 24:07.487
I'm gonna take care of it.

24:29.342 --> 24:31.303
Captain.
You wanted to see me?

24:35.640 --> 24:37.517
Check out this number.

24:37.601 --> 24:40.729
Get all calls made, received,
and where it's been the last three weeks.

24:40.812 --> 24:41.688
Yes, sir.

24:42.355 --> 24:44.274
OH HYEJIN

24:45.150 --> 24:46.359
It's classified.

24:47.319 --> 24:48.403
Yes, sir.

24:58.538 --> 25:01.041
Asshole, get going.

25:01.124 --> 25:03.376
Have a nice day.

25:04.127 --> 25:05.712
I'll walk on my own.

25:05.795 --> 25:07.088
- What?
- Let's get you processed.

25:07.172 --> 25:08.340
Hey.

25:09.049 --> 25:10.175
What are you doing here?

25:10.258 --> 25:12.052
We said to take a few more days off.

25:12.135 --> 25:13.512
Cabin fever.

25:13.595 --> 25:15.430
We'll catch Do Gangjae soon.

25:20.018 --> 25:23.230
Hey, they want us to carry firearms.
Pick up your gun.

25:23.313 --> 25:25.273
- Okay.
- I got it, punk.

25:25.357 --> 25:26.775
Here. You forgot this.

25:26.858 --> 25:27.859
Thanks.

25:29.819 --> 25:30.987
You're here.

25:31.947 --> 25:32.989
Are you okay?

25:33.490 --> 25:34.824
I'm doing fine, sir.

25:35.617 --> 25:36.952
Captain Cha.

25:37.869 --> 25:39.287
Hey. Come in.

25:43.375 --> 25:45.877
Jiwoo.
Did you hear from your dad?

25:49.297 --> 25:51.466
What did you say that make him come home?

25:55.595 --> 25:56.805
OH HYEJIN

25:58.807 --> 26:00.475
It's really good to see you again.

26:03.812 --> 26:04.980
Do you know her?

26:08.149 --> 26:09.276
Yes.

26:09.359 --> 26:11.987
I saw her a few times
when she was with Violent Crimes.

26:12.946 --> 26:14.322
She's a good worker.

26:17.409 --> 26:18.493
Come on.

26:34.259 --> 26:35.510
Detective Oh.

26:36.011 --> 26:37.095
We should…

26:37.929 --> 26:39.222
grab dinner soon.

27:01.328 --> 27:03.163
Yoon Donghoon's daughter…

27:05.081 --> 27:06.708
Did you find out anything else?

27:09.836 --> 27:11.254
No, she's just nowhere.

27:12.297 --> 27:14.758
She vanished
after the thing with her father.

27:17.385 --> 27:18.553
Why do you ask?

27:22.307 --> 27:24.225
The missing gun was at a crime scene.

27:28.355 --> 27:29.397
Yoon Donghoon's gun?

27:38.907 --> 27:42.202
VIOLENT CRIMES TEAM 3
SERGEANT CHO JINSAE

27:43.036 --> 27:45.121
I've narrowed it down
to two places.

27:54.422 --> 27:56.508
Cho Jinsae met with Cha Giho.

28:10.188 --> 28:14.442
INCHANG METROPOLITAN POLICE AGENCY

28:19.280 --> 28:21.282
Are you still looking
for your dad's killer?

28:22.450 --> 28:23.785
Why did you lie?

28:25.537 --> 28:27.414
Hmm.

28:31.084 --> 28:33.712
Because something entertaining
seems to be going on.

28:39.175 --> 28:40.593
Here. I got a tip for you.

28:42.095 --> 28:43.179
Your dad's case…

28:43.930 --> 28:45.724
got buried by Cha Giho.

28:46.266 --> 28:47.559
Interesting, huh?

28:49.853 --> 28:51.104
I heard a gun was found.

28:52.188 --> 28:53.606
Is Cha Giho the killer?

28:56.568 --> 28:58.319
If you tell anyone about who I am…

28:58.403 --> 29:00.363
What would I gain
from exposing you?

29:00.947 --> 29:02.490
Just a pain in the ass.

29:05.201 --> 29:06.286
Best of luck.

29:29.726 --> 29:32.854
Firearm number 20KG0637.

29:32.937 --> 29:34.439
Corporal Oh Hye-jin.

29:35.356 --> 29:36.566
Confirmed.

29:41.112 --> 29:42.405
That's right.

29:42.489 --> 29:44.115
We'll put out an APB.

29:45.617 --> 29:46.534
Now?

29:48.620 --> 29:49.537
Okay.

29:50.622 --> 29:54.167
The police are conducting a manhunt
for Do Gangjae and Kim Cheolho

29:54.250 --> 29:56.961
on suspicions of murder
and distribution of drugs.

29:57.045 --> 29:59.923
They've distributed
ten billion won's worth of LSD

30:00.006 --> 30:01.966
since November of last year.

30:02.050 --> 30:04.093
Moreover, they are under suspicion
of murdering

30:04.177 --> 30:06.554
four members of a competitor organization.

30:07.680 --> 30:09.849
The police are asking
for assistance from the public

30:09.933 --> 30:12.310
to capture these dangerous criminals.

30:15.146 --> 30:18.399
The government has issued
a new policy on real estate…

30:23.363 --> 30:25.323
Do Gangjae doesn't know we have you.

30:26.658 --> 30:28.993
First one who grab the phone
will have a different future.

30:33.790 --> 30:34.874
You take the phone,

30:35.500 --> 30:36.584
you're dead.

30:40.421 --> 30:41.798
The three of you, out.

30:42.841 --> 30:44.509
You hear him? Get up.

30:45.635 --> 30:47.303
Get up, you three! Get up!

30:48.137 --> 30:49.347
You. Get out.

30:50.723 --> 30:52.559
Motherfucker. Call and you're dead.

30:52.642 --> 30:54.060
Get out of here. Out!

30:55.186 --> 30:56.729
- Get out.
- Good thinking.

31:02.193 --> 31:03.194
Yoon Jiwoo.

31:05.238 --> 31:07.198
What are you doing with that girl, huh?

31:09.868 --> 31:11.286
She asked for this.

31:15.832 --> 31:16.875
You see,

31:18.293 --> 31:20.545
I've caught many bad guys,

31:21.754 --> 31:23.882
and you're a real demon, my friend.

31:27.343 --> 31:29.554
A junkie like you wouldn't get it.

31:31.931 --> 31:33.558
It's called conviction.

31:36.185 --> 31:38.813
I don't know much
about shit like conviction.

31:39.314 --> 31:41.691
But the price of my silence has reason.

31:48.865 --> 31:50.909
A few bags of drugs won't cut it.

31:52.660 --> 31:53.745
I see.

32:00.168 --> 32:02.128
You never disappoint me.

32:02.211 --> 32:03.046
Mm.

32:05.089 --> 32:08.009
Hey, Mr. Hwang. How thick is it?

32:10.219 --> 32:12.722
You son of a bitch. Fuck!

32:12.805 --> 32:14.098
You prick. Hey!

32:15.433 --> 32:17.852
I'm a detective, you son of a bitch.

32:17.936 --> 32:19.103
Let me go!

32:19.187 --> 32:20.480
You son of a bitch.

32:44.295 --> 32:45.463
I just got here.

32:47.006 --> 32:49.217
- Ha! Good job.
- Why are you paying him?

32:49.300 --> 32:50.802
I'm in a good mood.

33:01.187 --> 33:04.607
So? You let her through,
you moron?

33:05.233 --> 33:06.317
Shit.

33:06.401 --> 33:07.402
Hang up.

33:11.239 --> 33:13.783
Chair. Have a seat.

33:17.120 --> 33:19.330
What now?

33:20.039 --> 33:22.959
Why do you bastards keep bugging me?
Goddamn it.

33:23.042 --> 33:25.169
You were the one
that sold me out to Gangjae.

33:29.674 --> 33:32.635
I only did because I was told to.

33:37.390 --> 33:38.516
This is a dilemma.

33:41.978 --> 33:44.647
How do I get rid of the guy
who tried to kill me?

33:52.572 --> 33:55.450
I can be a cop and arrest you
for conspiracy to murder.

33:58.578 --> 34:00.663
Or I can leak it to Choi Mujin

34:00.747 --> 34:03.332
that you're Do Gangjae's puppet
who attacked his gym.

34:03.416 --> 34:04.625
I was not!

34:06.961 --> 34:08.379
All I did was get the drugs.

34:12.967 --> 34:14.927
But would Choi Mujin believe you?

34:17.638 --> 34:18.723
Yeah…

34:18.806 --> 34:20.349
That's the better option.

34:22.935 --> 34:25.396
It'll be a pain in the ass
to incriminate you.

34:25.480 --> 34:27.231
Wait… Shit. Hold on.

34:35.364 --> 34:36.908
What do you want?

34:37.950 --> 34:38.993
Tell me.

34:57.220 --> 35:00.473
Do Gangjae is fleeing
the country by boat.

35:40.221 --> 35:41.097
Yeah?

35:41.848 --> 35:43.266
Captain Cha Giho?

35:47.228 --> 35:48.479
This is Do Gangjae.

35:55.778 --> 35:58.072
Why? Turning yourself in?

35:59.699 --> 36:02.160
- What? Like hell I am.
- Do Gangjae.

36:02.243 --> 36:03.452
Do Gangjae.

36:04.287 --> 36:06.747
I'm just trying to help you out.

36:13.671 --> 36:15.506
