39:17.355 --> 39:19.982
JEON PILDO

39:23.944 --> 39:26.238
DETECTIVE OH HYEJIN

39:35.873 --> 39:36.874
Shit.

39:37.500 --> 39:39.085
Stupid narcs.

40:00.981 --> 40:02.566
Don't move. Stay in position.

40:02.650 --> 40:03.984
Don't move. Stay in position.

40:09.949 --> 40:10.950
Gangjae.

40:12.952 --> 40:14.495
Walk over and say hi.

40:23.337 --> 40:24.713
