45:28.934 --> 45:29.977
Hands up.

45:40.362 --> 45:41.488
Get out of here.

45:42.656 --> 45:43.490
Move it!

45:59.840 --> 46:01.925
You stupid bitch.

46:02.509 --> 46:04.303
You don't know anything.

46:05.888 --> 46:06.930
Drop it.

46:07.639 --> 46:08.724
